# Left Ctrl chord suppresses Esc; held Left Ctrl repeats and late release gives no Esc.
0 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
0 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
100 in key KEY_A down
100 out key KEY_A down
150 in key KEY_A up
150 out key KEY_A up
200 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
200 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
300 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
300 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL down
600 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL repeat
600 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL repeat
700 in key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
700 out key KEY_LEFTCTRL up
